name: Approved remaining actual Review retains human authority and original failed receipt
size: 120x36
require-env: KUZUSHI_DEVEX_TARGET
cwd: @TARGET
env-unset: NODE_OPTIONS KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL NO_COLOR
env: HOME=/private/tmp/kuzushi-live-owned-investigation-20261010/home KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/preserved_live_review.py @TARGET @ART prepare
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: campaign live-owned-review-preserved-20261011
require-live-snap: 25 live-owned-review-preserved-20261011 | approved-plan
nav-mode:
keys: L
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/preserved_live_review.py @TARGET @ART wait
keys: r
require-live-snap: 25 1 completed | completed-review
expect: work finished
expect-not: L resume
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 review-001 | completed-job
resize: 160x48
require-live-snap: 25 1 completed | job-160x48
resize: 96x89
require-live-snap: 25 1 completed | job-96x89
resize: 80x24
require-live-snap: 25 1 completed | job-80x24
resize: 60x20
require-live-snap: 25 1 completed | job-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 25 1 completed | job-40x12
ask: Does the actual completed Review remain one consumed job, with unknown dollars and no resume action after work ends?
resize: 120x36
submit: campaign live-owned-review-raw-20261010
require-live-snap: 25 1 failed | retained-original-failure
submit: open F-0001
require-live-snap: 25 public-example.env | retained-human-decision
expect: Owned public documentation example
resize: 160x48
require-live-snap: 25 rejected_false_positive | human-160x48
resize: 96x89
require-live-snap: 25 rejected_false_positive | human-96x89
resize: 80x24
require-live-snap: 25 rejected_false_positive | human-80x24
resize: 60x20
require-live-snap: 25 rejected_false_positive | human-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 25 rejected_false_positive | human-40x12
nav-mode:
keys: NPage NPage
live-snap: decision-source-40x12
ask: Is the retained human FP decision readable, while the new completed Review remains distinct from the original failed attempt?
resize: 120x36
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 6 committed / 6 calls | exhausted-report
expect: 0 protected review remaining
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/preserved_live_review.py @TARGET @ART reported
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=/private/tmp/kuzushi-live-owned-investigation-20261010/home KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: campaign live-owned-review-preserved-20261011
require-live-snap: 25 1 completed | recovered-review
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 6 committed / 6 calls | recovered-report
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/preserved_live_review.py @TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart retain completed Review, human decision, original failure and all six spent requests without creating further work?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
